Running: 2026-09-04 23:07:29

---Arguments from command-line---
   1  arg: -o:sig1prod
   2  arg: -fx:1e6
   3  arg: -fy:1e-3
   4  arg: -xlog
   5  arg: -lines
   6  arg: -sym
   7  arg: 92-U-238(P,*)*,*,SIG
   8  arg: 92-U-0(P,*)*,*,SIG
   9  arg: -prod:Zr-97
   10 arg: -symw:11
   11 arg: -annot:1000,90,<b>Production<br>cross sections</b>
   ---str2annot:[1000,90,<b>Production<br>cross sections</b>] --> ('<b>Production<br>cross sections</b>', 1000.0, 90.0)

---Input:
   Reaction:  ['92-U-238(P,*)*,*,SIG', '92-U-0(P,*)*,*,SIG']
   xn:        x1
   x1range:   None - None
   x2range:   None - None
   x3range:   None - None
   fx:        1000000.0
   fy:        0.001
   nPntMin:   1
   xrange:    None
   Output:    sig1prod
   x4ei:       and (prod like '%Zr-97' or outParticles like '%[Zr-97]%')


---Connect to SQL database---
___getConnSQLite: file:../../x4sqlite1.db?mode=rw
   Connected to: [sqlite3]

